    // Each tag byte: (type in low 2 bits)
    // Type 0: literal, Type 1: copy with 1-byte offset, Type 2: copy with 2-byte offset, Type 3: copy with 4-byte offset
    // For literal: if (n<60) len = n+1, else extra bytes.

